@startuml
!include ../_fragments/style.puml
!include ../_fragments/legend.puml
!include ../_fragments/lifelines.puml


BP_STYLE()
BP_LIFELINES()
BP_LEGEND()


title LIVE: решение → ордера → позиция (M11)\n@version M11.v1
autonumber


Scheduler -> Live: session tick (per series)
Live -> DB: fetch last quorum_decision_event (closed bar)
alt action = ENTER_*
Live -> Risk: check 1% risk, isolated/x10, loss-streak
Risk --> Live: sizing, SL/TP/trailing
Live -> OrderRouter: build OrderIntent (entry + bracket)
OrderRouter -> ExConn: place order(s) with client_order_id
ExConn -> ExREST: API call(s)
ExREST --> ExConn: ack{external_order_id}
ExConn --> OrderRouter: ack
OrderRouter -> DB: persist live_order, intent
else action = MODIFY_SLTP
Live -> OrderRouter: amend protective orders
OrderRouter -> ExConn: amend/cancel
else action = EXIT/REVERSE
Live -> OrderRouter: send close (market/limit)
end


== Исполнения и реконсиляция ==
ExWS --> ExConn: fill events
ExConn --> Live: fills
Live -> DB: persist live_fill, position_ledger
par periodic reconcile
Reconciler -> ExConn: fetchOpenOrders/fetchPositions
ExConn -> ExREST: REST polling
ExREST --> ExConn: state
ExConn --> Reconciler: state
Reconciler -> DB: fix drifts (append logs)
end


note over Live,OrderRouter
Идемпотентность: детерминированный client_order_id;\n
один писатель на связку exchange_instrument×TF
end note
@enduml